{
  "key": 17426,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0502_T07R0202_EventMons_Text_CostumeIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! You’re a Gym Leader now?\n",
        "Then you need a star for your\r",
        "shows!\r",
        "This Pikachu loves dressing up\n",
        "more than anything. Its costumes\r",
        "are my life’s work. Please, take\n",
        "it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0502_T07R0202_EventMons_Text_CostumeExplain",
      "en_US": [
        "I have five costumes for it, but\n",
        "each one has to suit you first.\r",
        "Rock Star is cool: win 7 in a\n",
        "row in the Academy’s Battle\r",
        "Hall.\r",
        "Belle is beautiful: decorate\n",
        "your Gym with 20 pieces or more.\r",
        "Pop Star is cute: win the\n",
        "Convention’s Fairy hall.\r",
        "Ph.D. is smart: hear every\n",
        "lecture at the Academy.\r",
        "Libre is tough: win the\n",
        "Convention’s Fighting hall.\r",
        "Come back any time and I’ll\n",
        "dress it up!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0502_T07R0202_CeladonCity_Condominiums_2F_Text_GameFreakMeetingRoom",
      "en_US": "Game Freak Meeting Room"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0502_T07R0202_PokemonJournal_Text_SpecialFeatureErika",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon Journal\r",
        "Special Feature: Celadon Gym\n",
        "Leader Erika!\r",
        "Rumor has it that if you peek into\n",
        "Celadon Gym, you can often\f",
        "see Erika snoozing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0502_T07R0202_EventMons_Text_CostumeNotYet",
      "en_US": [
        "I make costumes for Pokémon.\n",
        "Right now I’m sewing for a very\r",
        "special client…\r",
        "A Gym Leader, maybe? Come back\n",
        "when you are one!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0502_T07R0202_EventMons_Text_CostumeAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "Costumes ready for you:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} of 5. Shall I dress\r",
        "up your Pikachu?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0502_T07R0202_EventMons_Text_CostumeWhich",
      "en_US": "Which Pikachu?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0502_T07R0202_EventMons_Text_CostumePick",
      "en_US": "Which costume?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0502_T07R0202_EventMons_Text_CostumeCosplay",
      "en_US": "no Costume"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0502_T07R0202_EventMons_Text_CostumeDone",
      "en_US": [
        "There! {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} looks\n",
        "wonderful. A new costume, a new\r",
        "move to show it off!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0502_T07R0202_EventMons_Text_Received",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0502_T07R0202_EventMons_Text_CostumeLater",
      "en_US": "Come back any time!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0502_T07R0202_EventMons_Text_CostumeNotPikachu",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm… My costumes only fit the\n",
        "Pikachu I gave you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0502_T07R0202_EventMons_Text_NoRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh… There’s no room for it in\n",
        "your party or your boxes. Make\r",
        "some space and come back!"
      ]
    },
